{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：08:46 2026-08-21 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今(21日)早上7時14分，土瓜灣四川街1號一幢八層高唐樓，一名男子被發現危站天台，警方接報到場封路，浙江街至落山道一段下鄉道，車輛不得駛入。消防在地面開氣墊戒備，警員正向事主展開游說。</p>\n<img alt=\"男子危站天台。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/72ce06a5aa28a93e9909ee760588f4f9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-21_at_08_30_51_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防開氣墊戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d5319293ba1d6e6027ae665a917647ac/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-21_at_08_30_53_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9ebdc3a7ba9b4690b623a2684b9a0583/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-21_at_08_30_52_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/90de803dc3cd49d45dd09d35d865ae1a/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-21_at_08_30_52_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"消防開氣墊戒備。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bcddb50e4bf6ae19cc2758d8448d8cd3/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-21_at_08_30_51_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/84e20e9f757ac9f6d00cf34c515a6d76/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-21_at_08_30_51.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T00:59:47.262568+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}